	('a34b09c5-646b-4eb2-a27b-4bfa74a6dcd7', '11fecf5e-11c3-4e55-bda3-9116a0363b1c', 'ceabb545-91b8-427a-84df-331eea9352f6', '42ec7659-5b7a-4507-9d31-b93b223c69ae', 'completed', NULL, '2025-09-30 20:36:20.444+00', '2025-09-30 20:41:32.711+00', '2025-09-30 20:41:32.800542+00', '8261800e-cf5c-4dd9-acc1-8345de53560d', '1c10f723-806e-4b94-9140-540dc5651f15', '16c93d67-2433-4308-a8a2-c3917294f21b', 10, NULL, '2K', 5, '1:1', 'fast', 'a34b09c5-646b-4eb2-a27b-4bfa74a6dcd7', '{"prompt": "A dark, cinematic studio portrait of FACEMODEL, a woman, late 20s, blue eyes, slim with a narrow frame, afro hair, wearing navy tailored blazer worn open over a white ruffled blouse, luxury tailoring. The lighting is soft and low-key but controlled, with subtle directional shadows on the face for depth while keeping the overall tone low and moody. The background is a perfectly flat, seamless deep dusty rose, evenly lit with no gradients, shadows, or depth—appearing as a smooth paper backdrop. The subject is tightly framed from the upper chest with minimal space above the hairline, filling 90% of the vertical frame. Captured on a full-frame camera with an 85mm f/5.6 lens for greater depth of field and minimal background separation. The overall mood is subdued, minimalistic, and intimate, with strong contrast, defined shadows, and a highly professional editorial style.", "enabled": true}', NULL),
	('7f783e00-b735-4084-b2ce-90ba7d50ebfe', '11fecf5e-11c3-4e55-bda3-9116a0363b1c', '0d7e19e5-b7fb-49ba-949d-3f6694c0ff35', 'd2f3abef-143e-4e36-a708-1a0774d2d063', 'completed', NULL, '2025-09-30 21:29:17.548+00', '2025-09-30 21:33:41.217+00', '2025-09-30 21:33:41.319125+00', '9666b908-d7dc-4e71-8e01-6b9f79f2d5ea', 'e81a6d5e-aa7e-413a-9fbf-4ee547084411', '211768fc-3865-4469-b2ed-45c0e400a715', 10, NULL, '2K', 5, '1:1', 'fast', '7f783e00-b735-4084-b2ce-90ba7d50ebfe', '{"prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman, late 20s, green eyes, slim with a narrow frame, medium to long hair, tightly framed and partially obscured by hard-edged shadows, the expression calm and introspective with a sense of mystery. The lighting combines a strong golden-amber key light striking one side of the face with a teal rim light outlining the silhouette, creating bold chiaroscuro contrast and dramatic shadow play. The background is an urban street at night, glowing with neon signage from an old diner: bold amber letters blur into glowing shapes, their reflections bleeding into the teal-blue dusk sky. The diner’s signage flickers softly, casting uneven halos of light that smear across the frame, while the surrounding street dissolves into strong hazy bokeh, vintage lens blur, and subtle halation. Wearing Black moto jacket with zip closure, zippered sleeves, styled over a white fitted turtleneck top, high fashion editorial style. The overall mood is cinematic and noir-inflected, enhanced by film grain, glowing highlights, and a palette of neon teal and golden amber that evokes moody 35mm fashion editorials and neon-lit scenes.", "enabled": true}', '{}'),
	('03e02b15-cf25-4ae8-a79e-94ed20aec4ab', '11fecf5e-11c3-4e55-bda3-9116a0363b1c', 'bf55dc55-f192-434b-b8a4-965390229aeb', '42ec7659-5b7a-4507-9d31-b93b223c69ae', 'completed', NULL, '2025-09-30 21:33:27.271+00', '2025-09-30 21:37:05.587+00', '2025-09-30 21:37:05.710193+00', '3f220441-873d-462c-bb43-64a0b863f84b', 'abc59c74-d5bb-4edf-aad2-13027d9b4bcd', 'c26e6df5-5297-4e0f-92b7-770a9ca04821', 10, NULL, '2K', 5, '1:1', 'fast', '03e02b15-cf25-4ae8-a79e-94ed20aec4ab', '{"prompt": "A man in his late twenties to early thirties with brown eyes, an athletic lean build, and defined facial features. His skin has a warm, healthy tan. He is dressed in a black crewneck sweater made of premium knitwear. His eyes are perfectly round with symmetrical irises, sharp pupils, crisp sclera, and natural reflections, with photorealistic detail and no distortion or asymmetry. His neck shows no Adam’s apple.\nThe portrait takes place in a controlled studio scene with a seamless deep slate blue backdrop, perfectly flat, evenly lit, and smooth like paper, with no gradients, shadows, or depth. The subject is tightly framed from the upper chest with minimal space above the hairline, filling about 90% of the vertical frame.\nThe subject remains composed and motionless, his gaze steady, conveying an intimate and professional presence.\nLighting is soft, low-key, and controlled, with side and directional shadows that sculpt his face to add depth while maintaining a moody tone. Shot as a medium close-up, eye-level, center composition. Captured with a full-frame camera and an 85mm f/5.6 lens for sharpness, fine skin detail, and minimal background separation.\nThe overall aesthetic is cinematic and editorial: subdued, minimalistic, and intimate, with heightened contrast, clearly defined shadows, and ultra-high facial detail. The visual style matches professional magazine portraiture and cinematic photography.\nBooster: perfectly round iris, photorealistic eye detail, symmetrical eyes, ultra-high detail face, crisp natural reflections, professional editorial photography, cinematic studio portrait, premium fashion look.", "enabled": true}', '{}'),
	('700d080b-2d87-4a41-9301-da81dd7f9ae4', '11fecf5e-11c3-4e55-bda3-9116a0363b1c', 'bf55dc55-f192-434b-b8a4-965390229aeb', '42ec7659-5b7a-4507-9d31-b93b223c69ae', 'completed', NULL, '2025-09-30 21:34:26.744+00', '2025-09-30 21:38:43.803+00', '2025-09-30 21:38:43.941988+00', '3f220441-873d-462c-bb43-64a0b863f84b', 'abc59c74-d5bb-4edf-aad2-13027d9b4bcd', 'c26e6df5-5297-4e0f-92b7-770a9ca04821', 10, NULL, '2K', 5, '1:1', 'fast', '700d080b-2d87-4a41-9301-da81dd7f9ae4', '{"prompt": "A cinematic studio portrait of a man in his late 20s to early 30s, athletic and lean with defined features, warm tan skin, and brown eyes with perfectly round irises, symmetrical eyes, sharp pupils, crisp sclera, and natural reflections; wearing a black premium knit crewneck sweater. Medium close-up, chest-up, center composition, eye-level, tightly framed to fill 90% of the vertical frame. Captured on a full-frame camera with an 85mm f/5.6 lens, ultra-detailed skin texture, professional sharpness, minimal background separation. Seamless deep slate blue backdrop, flat and smooth with no gradients or shadows. Soft low-key side lighting with subtle directional shadows for depth, high contrast, subdued and minimalistic mood. Ultra-high detail face, photorealistic magazine portrait, cinematic editorial style.", "enabled": true}', '{}'),
